    "// fullScreenCover 는 쓸어내려 닫히지 않는다. 출구는 직접 만들어야 한다.\n.fullScreenCover(isPresented: $editing) {\n    EditorView()\n        .toolbar {\n            ToolbarItem(placement: .topBarLeading) { Button(\"취소\") { editing = false } }\n            ToolbarItem(placement: .topBarTrailing) { Button(\"완료\") { save() } }\n        }\n}": {
      "comment": "On-screen SwiftUI code sample. Translate only Korean comments and string literals; keep Swift code as is.",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "// fullScreenCover doesn't close with a swipe down. You have to build the exit yourself.\n.fullScreenCover(isPresented: $editing) {\n    EditorView()\n        .toolbar {\n            ToolbarItem(placement: .topBarLeading) { Button(\"Cancel\") { editing = false } }\n            ToolbarItem(placement: .topBarTrailing) { Button(\"Done\") { save() } }\n        }\n}"
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "// fullScreenCover doesn't close with a swipe down. You have to build the exit yourself.\n.fullScreenCover(isPresented: $editing) {\n    EditorView()\n        .toolbar {\n            ToolbarItem(placement: .topBarLeading) { Button(\"Cancel\") { editing = false } }\n            ToolbarItem(placement: .topBarTrailing) { Button(\"Done\") { save() } }\n        }\n}"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "// fullScreenCover は下にスワイプしても閉じない。出口は自分で作る必要がある。\n.fullScreenCover(isPresented: $editing) {\n    EditorView()\n        .toolbar {\n            ToolbarItem(placement: .topBarLeading) { Button(\"キャンセル\") { editing = false } }\n            ToolbarItem(placement: .topBarTrailing) { Button(\"完了\") { save() } }\n        }\n}"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "// fullScreenCover 는 쓸어내려 닫히지 않는다. 출구는 직접 만들어야 한다.\n.fullScreenCover(isPresented: $editing) {\n    EditorView()\n        .toolbar {\n            ToolbarItem(placement: .topBarLeading) { Button(\"취소\") { editing = false } }\n            ToolbarItem(placement: .topBarTrailing) { Button(\"완료\") { save() } }\n        }\n}"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
