    "// 기준: 액션이 대상 위에 붙어 있는가?\n.swipeActions { Button(\"삭제\", role: .destructive) { … } }\n.contextMenu { … }": {
      "comment": "On-screen SwiftUI code sample. Translate only Korean comments and string literals; keep Swift code as is.",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "// Criterion: Is the action attached to its target?\n.swipeActions { Button(\"Delete\", role: .destructive) { … } }\n.contextMenu { … }"
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "// Criterion: Is the action attached to its target?\n.swipeActions { Button(\"Delete\", role: .destructive) { … } }\n.contextMenu { … }"
