    "// 큰 자리: 스크롤 콘텐츠 맨 위의 커스텀 헤더\n// 작은 자리: principal 에 같은 정보를 압축해 넣는다\n.toolbar {\n    ToolbarItem(placement: .principal) {\n        HStack(spacing: 6) { Avatar(); Text(name).bold() }\n    }\n}\n.toolbarTitleDisplayMode(.inline)": {
      "comment": "On-screen SwiftUI code sample. Translate only Korean comments and string literals; keep Swift code as is.",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "// Big spot: a custom header at the top of the scroll content\n// Small spot: compress the same info into principal\n.toolbar {\n    ToolbarItem(placement: .principal) {\n        HStack(spacing: 6) { Avatar(); Text(name).bold() }\n    }\n}\n.toolbarTitleDisplayMode(.inline)"
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "// Big spot: a custom header at the top of the scroll content\n// Small spot: compress the same info into principal\n.toolbar {\n    ToolbarItem(placement: .principal) {\n        HStack(spacing: 6) { Avatar(); Text(name).bold() }\n    }\n}\n.toolbarTitleDisplayMode(.inline)"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
