            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Schat in de kapotte versie op het oog welk percentage van het scherm de eigenlijke inhoud inneemt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "어긴 쪽은 \"5km\", \"김하늘\" 처럼 **표기를 문자열로 박아** 뒀습니다.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The broken version **hard-codes the formatting into strings**, like \"5km\" and \"Olivia Kim\"."
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The broken version **hard-codes the formatting into strings**, like \"5km\" and \"Olivia Kim\"."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ルールを破った画面は、「5km」「高橋 陽菜」のように**表記を文字列で埋め込んで**います。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "어긴 쪽은 \"5km\", \"김하늘\" 처럼 **표기를 문자열로 박아** 뒀습니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
